  "body": "CCC & TITLE ISSUED - MOVE-IN READY\r\n\r\nLOT 3 SOLD \r\nLOT 4 SOLD \r\nLOT 7 SOLD\r\n\r\nLOTS 1, 2, 5 & 6 STILL AVAILABLE - FOR NOW!\r\n\r\nLots 1 & 2 - Asking Price $949,000\r\nLots 5 & 6 - Asking Price $749,000\r\n\r\nIt is rare to find beauty, quality and genuine presence matched with affordability. But here you are.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 49 Stredwick - born from pride, passion and a belief that affordable homes should deliver the style, quality and individuality you deserve.\r\n\r\nPerfect for first-home buyers who refuse to compromise on style, or downsizers ready to lose the maintenance but not the wow.\r\nCurved brickwork, open-brick detailing, soaring proportions and floor-to-ceiling glass create serious street presence - designed to make you proud to come home and passers-by look twice.\r\n\r\nInside, the detail continues. An LED-lit designer kitchen with Bosch appliances, built-in TV cabinetry, contemporary bathrooms, natural light and premium finishes make this home feel every bit as good as it looks.\r\n\r\nStyle. Lifestyle. Quality. And maybe just a little ego boost when friends come over.\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD: rwmilford.co.nz/MFD30596 (scroll down to documents)\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE:\r\n- CCC & Title now issued\r\n- Brand-new architectural home\r\n- Ground floor with block construction\r\n- 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms\r\n- Curved and open-brick architecture\r\n- Floor-to-ceiling glass bi-fold door\r\n- Designer kitchen with Bosch appliances\r\n- LED kitchen lighting\r\n- Built-in TV cabinetry\r\n- Two heat pumps\r\n- Private outdoor living\r\n- Off-street parking\r\n- Premium, low-maintenance finishes\r\n- Halo 10-year warranty\r\n\r\nBeautifully crafted by Prominence Property, 49 Stredwick reflects a developer driven by design, pride and a belief that homes should add something to both the people who live in them and the community around them.\r\n\r\n\"Every home should tell a story-a story of elegance, purpose, and belonging.\" - Sharon Tran, Founder\r\n\r\nBeautifully crafted. Seriously cool. Surprisingly affordable.\r\n\r\nCome and see what affordable looks like when design comes first.",
